{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rainbullet</strong> is a <strong>minimalist 2D bullet hell</strong> game that plunges you into a depressing nightmare of strange colors and sounds. Control a point of light in the void and survive a barrage of projectiles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your sole objective is to challenge the <strong>seven shades of color</strong>, each with a unique attack and defense logic. But beware: each victory brings you closer to madness, forcing you to make progression decisions so crucial they will determine whether you continue or end your game forever. All of this is presented in a <strong>minimalist, chalk-drawn visual style</strong>, reflecting the vision of a solo indie developer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you're looking for a relentless challenge with a distinct psychological and aesthetic twist, <strong>Rainbullet</strong> awaits. Will you be able to master the advantages and disadvantages of your own progression to conquer all seven?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4075370?t=1761235798","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4075370?t=1761235798","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4075370/9ee653f6c7b7cdd43a0d8b7b84d155e5d6c5d07a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761235798","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4075370/9ee653f6c7b7cdd43a0d8b7b84d155e5d6c5d07a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761235798","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rainbullet</strong> is a <strong>minimalist 2D bullet hell</strong> game that plunges you into a depressing nightmare of strange colors and sounds. Control a point of light in the void and survive a barrage of projectiles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your sole objective is to challenge the <strong>seven shades of color</strong>, each with a unique attack and defense logic. But beware: each victory brings you closer to madness, forcing you to make progression decisions so crucial they will determine whether you continue or end your game forever. All of this is presented in a <strong>minimalist, chalk-drawn visual style</strong>, reflecting the vision of a solo indie developer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you're looking for a relentless challenge with a distinct psychological and aesthetic twist, <strong>Rainbullet</strong> awaits. Will you be able to master the advantages and disadvantages of your own progression to conquer all seven?</p>","developers":["Naker098"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4075370/d3bdb7d09e71ddbb428aa3a998699460e90edf4d/header.jpg?t=1761235798","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Debian 10/Ubuntu 18.04<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Procesador Dual Core de 2.0 GHz o equivalente<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Graphics card compatible with OpenGL 3.3 or higher<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 150 MB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> Any compatible with the system<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> It is recommended to use Mesa drivers for Intel/AMD graphics, or proprietary drivers for NVIDIA.</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</stron